---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import BookIntro from '../components/BookIntro.astro';
import FocusArea from '../components/FocusArea.astro';
import ResourceCard from '../components/ResourceCard.astro';
import SectionLabel from '../components/SectionLabel.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Directed Edges / Design system strategy and operations"
  description="Get help with challenges like setting a design system vision and strategy, aligning stakeholders, growing a design systems team, and delivering measurable value over time."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-10">
    <SectionLabel label="Services" eyebrow />
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-tight mb-6">Design system strategy and planning</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-muted mb-4">
      Getting a design system started and keeping it thriving can be a daunting challenge. Selling to stakeholders. Growing a team. Deliver consistently. Evolve and helping teams change over time. It can be complicated, risky and even exhausting at times.
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg text-muted mb-8">
      We can help you navigate these challenges to set up your design system for success. We've seen the patterns, shared the stories, and aligned stakeholders so that your teams can deliver, implement with and evolve a system over time.
    </p>
    <BookIntro />

    <FocusArea title="Strategy and planning">
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">Starting a system from scratch? Aligning stakeholders to shared vision and purpose? Charting a course to deliver a redesign? Forming a team to get the work done and measure its success?</p>
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">We help you navigate stakeholders to form a design system team and deliver breakthrough and incremental value over time.</p>
      <ul class="space-y-4 mt-6">
        <ResourceCard
          title="Starting a Design System"
          href="https://medium.com/eightshapes-llc/starting-a-design-system-6b909a578325"
          description="The arc to start a system: set a strategy, launch a first release, and operate regularly to foster adoption and community."
          source="Medium.com"
        />
        <ResourceCard
          title="Designing a Systems Team"
          href="https://medium.com/eightshapes-llc/designing-a-systems-team-d22f27a2d81d"
          description="Models and Lessons Learned to Scale a Team for an Enterprise."
          source="Medium.com"
        />
      </ul>
    </FocusArea>

    <FocusArea title="Roadmapping">
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">Beyond the next component, where is your design system going?</p>
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">We can help you solicit and prioritize needs, identify big bets to make, and deliver library features and capabilities over time.</p>
      <ul class="space-y-4 mt-6">
        <ResourceCard
          title="Design System Generations"
          href="https://medium.com/@nathanacurtis/design-system-generations-65f99960dc3d"
          description="An entire library is in play to be made, delivered, and implemented (again) across adopters."
          source="Medium.com"
        />
        <ResourceCard
          title="Designing a community-driven design systems roadmap"
          href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4MpGxmlOf7w"
          description="A talk by Jules Forrest of Credit Karma on roadmapping that was supported by office hours and async consulting with Nathan."
          source="Youtube.com, Figma Schema 2022 NY"
        />
      </ul>
    </FocusArea>

    <FocusArea title="Operations and process">
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">Is your design system process working well? Do you crank out features like a well-oiled machine? Does everyone know their role, makers and contributors alike?</p>
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">We can work with you to install ways-of-working as we have taught thousands of designers, engineers and teams for over 20 years.</p>
      <ul class="space-y-4 mt-6">
        <ResourceCard
          title="System UI is More Expensive Than Product UI"
          href="https://medium.com/eightshapes-llc/design-system-ui-is-more-expensive-than-a-product-teams-ui-f3c3e48c555"
          description="Comparing workflows to understand the extra effort needed to deliver high-quality features."
          source="Medium.com"
        />
        <ResourceCard
          title="Design Systems Support"
          href="https://medium.com/eightshapes-llc/design-systems-support-6722b6d9a259"
          description="Understand what types of incidents occur, in what channels they arise, and who's responsible to manage and resolve each one."
          source="Medium.com"
        />
        <ResourceCard
          title="Design System Communications"
          href="https://medium.com/eightshapes-llc/design-system-communications-ca679ffc36d3"
          description="Target your audiences, channels, and messages with a communications strategy to release features and manage change."
          source="Medium.com"
        />
      </ul>
    </FocusArea>

    <FocusArea title="Assessment">
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">Your design system is chugging along, releasing features. Adopters seem happy. But is the system healthy? Are you working on the right things? Do you all agree?</p>
      <p class="text-muted">We'll inform your roadmap using heuristic-based workshops, alignment sessions, and recommendations so you can move forward.</p>
    </FocusArea>

    <!-- Closing CTA -->
    <section class="my-10 py-10 border-t border-border">
      <h2 class="text-2xl mb-4">Ready to get started?</h2>
      <p class="text-muted mb-6">Let's connect to discuss your project's goals, scope and approach.</p>
      <BookIntro />
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
